      "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:01:10.971Z",
      "cooked": "<h4><a name=\"p-488781-does-anyone-know-how-to-use-this-feature-allow-internal-transfers-at-arms-length-price-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488781-does-anyone-know-how-to-use-this-feature-allow-internal-transfers-at-arms-length-price-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Does anyone know how to use this feature \" <strong>Allow Internal Transfers at Arm’s Length Price</strong>\"?</h4>\n<p>I have a company that produces animal food, and the company also owns a farm. We need to transfer the animal food form factory warehouse to the farm warehouse at a different price, not at the cost.<br>\nI asked ChatGPT, and it told me that the option in stock settings allows me to transfer goods between warehouses at different prices. But after I enabled this option, I cannot change the value in the stock entry of the material transfer.</p>",
